{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:721","content":{"id":721,"title":"加油站","content":[{"children":[{"text":"题目描述","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"498d919c-bc19-45c9-b7cc-dd56893df76d","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"在一条环路上有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"n","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 个加油站，其中第 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"i","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 个加油站有汽油 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"gas[i]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 升。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f6d5c6cc-661f-46c4-a58e-36a0221f562e","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"你有一辆油箱容量无限的的汽车，从第 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"i","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 个加油站开往第 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"i + 1","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 个加油站需要消耗汽油 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"cost[i]","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 升。你从其中的一个加油站出发，开始时油箱为空。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"41ba22d6-24ef-4469-a145-e26f71389657","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"给定两个整数数组 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"gas","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"cost","type":"formatted"},{"text":" ，如果你可以按顺序绕环路行驶一周，则返回出发时加油站的编号，否则返回 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"-1","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 。如果存在解，则保证它是唯一的。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0f5e1a1d-f427-45fb-96db-3da1d0ca39a9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"输入: ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"gas = [1,2,3,4,5], cost = [3,4,5,1,2]","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0e96ce04-399c-479f-87cd-a5ecd03a89a3","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"输出: ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"3","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"afe22ea0-8584-47c4-8740-fa90ed6c129b","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"解释:","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"570e36a0-b064-4e5a-81d0-1e85ea60fc84","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"从 3 号加油站(索引为 3 处)出发，可获得 4 升汽油。此时油箱有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"= 0 + 4 = 4","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 升汽油","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"654ba5df-e6ff-4bfd-9d70-d2bef2081537","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"642cb494-7448-4a37-8f75-a1fbde109a6e","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"开往 4 号加油站，此时油箱有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"4 - 1 + 5 = 8","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 升汽油","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"40eb02e6-33aa-4e1b-9cdf-8fe5f5b877c6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"b173875d-24e7-42a3-a80b-510757b4a67b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"开往 0 号加油站，此时油箱有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"8 - 2 + 1 = 7","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 升汽油","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"011414c5-fec2-46d7-a803-bacedc28f336","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"651f5137-272b-4ac0-b14e-d491dfbde2db","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"开往 1 号加油站，此时油箱有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"7 - 3 + 2 = 6","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 升汽油","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ca13c85c-fcd1-47dc-8583-b96eaa35dd89","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"b86cc53d-69c4-403d-8d93-4b8739e849da","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"开往 2 号加油站，此时油箱有 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"6 - 4 + 3 = 5","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 升汽油","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"8588d55e-7956-435c-b4a1-33d3fc5398da","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"4ce2d324-951f-43a2-ab89-9f025929feee","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"开往 3 号加油站，你需要消耗 ","type":"formatted"},{"code":true,"text":"5","type":"formatted"},{"text":" 升汽油，正好足够你返回到 3 号加油站。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"f0b91f64-b6a8-4494-b19e-a42d23ca88c7","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"133c7066-522e-493e-921b-591d3ed1a3ec","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"因此，3 可为起始索引。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"21839d5d-88e2-42ca-ba4a-b97728fb5b6a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"82c9bbad-6f7c-4503-b8e6-048b5b338416","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"fb38212f-dbc3-4670-902d-98e2c22780a1","t